# db/liquibase.properties is safe, required template source (${DB_*}
# envsubst placeholders only, no secrets) that the db Dockerfile COPYs at
# build time. This file gets copied verbatim into every project scaffolded
# from this template, so the negation below is the durable half of the fix -
# without it, every new project silently loses this file to the monorepo
# root .gitignore's bare `liquibase.properties` basename rule. The file is
# currently tracked here by history rather than by this negation (it
# predates the rule matching it) - delete-and-recreate would hit the bug,
# which is exactly what happened to `projects/NoizuPromptLingo` (untracked)
# versus its sibling `NoizuPromptLingo.old` (still tracked).
!db/liquibase.properties
